CAN interface 256: MOCK - NO HARDWARE (open)
VCU_Command=0x100, Motor_Status=0x110, DLC=8, 10ms, incrementing Alive
Motor script 1.3 - DC + two SG90 outputs with firmware diagnostics
Started in P/zero torque. Wait for READY, then enter a drive command.
Stop any Raw TX/Generator sending 0x100 before using this script.
forward 10 5 / d 10 5 : D, PWM 10%, 5 seconds (all four motors)
reverse 10 5 / r 10 5 : R, PWM 10%, 5 seconds (all four motors)
gear P/N/D/R : select gear with ZERO torque; does not start movement
torque D 400 5 : D, TorqueRequest=400 Nm, 5 seconds (demo PWM=10%)
s / p  : zero torque + P; n : neutral; b : brake
status : show 0x110 virtual RPM/state and command
quit   : send zero and end; help : show commands
Duration defaults to 5 seconds, maximum 60 seconds
left 20 5 / right 20 5 : request left/right 20 degrees for 5 seconds
steer -20 5 / center : signed angle request / angle zero
drive d 25 -20 5 : DC forward 25% + left20 degrees, both for 5 seconds
drive r 25 20 5 : DC reverse 25% + right20 degrees, both for 5 seconds
Requires firmware revision 3; SG90 PWM on PA0/PA1, 50Hz, center 1500us.
